@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Design — Reviewed folder copying
top to bottom direction
class migration_planner {
  + preview(...)
}
class placement {
  + match(...)
  + section(...)
  + snapshot(cmid)
}
class copy_decision {
  + snapshot(file)
  + classify(source, target)
}
class migration_executor {
  + queue(planid, digest)
  + execute(runid)
  + cancel(runid)
}
class folder_destination {
  + copy(source, targetcmid)
}
migration_planner --> placement
migration_planner --> copy_decision
migration_executor --> placement
migration_executor --> copy_decision
migration_executor --> folder_destination
migration_planner -[hidden]right-> migration_executor
placement -[hidden]right-> copy_decision
copy_decision -[hidden]right-> folder_destination
note bottom of folder_destination : Native additive save under an exclusive maintenance window.
@enduml
